/**
 * @mainpage libeasymcp2221++
 *
 * @brief Object-oriented C++17 adapter for libeasymcp2221.
 *
 * libeasymcp2221++ provides an idiomatic C++17 interface on top of
 * <a href="https://github.com/tobiasvogel/libeasymcp2221">libeasymcp2221</a>.
 * The C library remains responsible for USB transport and MCP2221 protocol
 * handling, while this adapter adds C++ ownership, strong value types,
 * stateful child objects, exceptions, and container-oriented APIs.
 *
 * @section main_features Features
 *
 * - RAII-based root device ownership with explicit close() support.
 * - Stateful @ref libeasymcp2221::I2cDevice "I2cDevice" and
 *   @ref libeasymcp2221::SmbusDevice "SmbusDevice" adapters.
 * - Typed GPIO polling through @ref libeasymcp2221::GpioPoller "GpioPoller".
 * - Strongly typed GPIO, ADC, DAC, clock, SRAM, flash, and USB configuration.
 * - Exception-based error translation while preserving native C error codes.
 * - Shared and static library support with CMake and pkg-config integration.
 *
 * @section main_start Getting started
 *
 * The root @ref libeasymcp2221::Device "Device" object opens an MCP2221(A)
 * and provides access to the stateful child adapters:
 *
 * @code{.cpp}
 * #include <libeasymcp2221++/libeasymcp2221++.h>
 *
 * int main()
 * {
 *     libeasymcp2221::Device device;
 *     auto sensor = device.i2cDevice(0x48);
 *
 *     // Use the stateful I2C adapter here.
 *     return 0;
 * }
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section main_objects Core objects
 *
 * - @ref libeasymcp2221::Device "Device" — root MCP2221(A) object and
 *   lifetime owner.
 * - @ref libeasymcp2221::I2cDevice "I2cDevice" — stateful adapter for one
 *   7-bit I2C target.
 * - @ref libeasymcp2221::SmbusDevice "SmbusDevice" — stateful SMBus adapter.
 * - @ref libeasymcp2221::GpioPoller "GpioPoller" — typed GPIO edge/event
 *   polling helper.
 *
 * @section main_relationship Relationship to libeasymcp2221
 *
 * libeasymcp2221++ is an adapter, not a second MCP2221 protocol
 * implementation. It intentionally reuses the mature C implementation from
 * <a href="https://github.com/tobiasvogel/libeasymcp2221">libeasymcp2221</a>
 * and exposes it through a C++17 object-oriented API.
 *
 * @section main_links Further information
 *
 * - <a href="https://github.com/tobiasvogel/libeasymcp2221-cpp">
 *   libeasymcp2221++ on GitHub</a>
 * - <a href="https://github.com/tobiasvogel/libeasymcp2221">
 *   libeasymcp2221 C library on GitHub</a>
 *
 * @section author Author
 *
 * Tobias X. Vogel
 *
 * @section license License
 * libeasymcp2221++ is distributed under the <a href="https://opensource.org/license/mit">MIT License</a>.
 */
